R-OH-5]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-26","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OH"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T18:49:12+00:00","id":"hr250-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-09","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-27","text":"Received in the Senate and Read twice and referred to the Committee on Rules and Administration."},"laws":[],"number":"250","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Congress","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"H001085","district":6,"fullName":"Rep. Houlahan, Chrissy [D-PA-6]","party":"D","state":"PA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-09","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p>This bill requires the Joint Committee on the Library to contract for and place a&nbsp;statue of Benjamin Franklin in the Capitol.</p><p>The committee shall place the statue in a permanent public location&nbsp;where it is accessible during a guided tour provided by the Capitol Visitor Center.</p><p>The contract must be executed by December 31, 2025, and the&nbsp;statue must be placed by&nbsp;December 31, 2026.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2025-02-10T20:20:31Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"To direct the Joint Committee on the Library to procure a statue of Benjamin Franklin for placement in the Capitol.","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-11T02:54:33Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-13T20:08:40Z"}
